Add scaled FP8 support when importing.

Scaled FP8 checkpoints store a weight_scale or scale_weight beside each FP8
weight. ComfyUI writes an F32 scalar. Other exporters write BF16 or F16
scalars, or one scale per output row. The importer ignored the scales, so
those weights came in off by a factor of 1/scale. Applying them while
decoding covers every importer that reads safetensors.
